00:00:01.969 --> 00:00:06.073 size:53% position:73% line:53%
25 ans plus tard, la communauté

00:00:04.171 --> 00:00:07.107 size:53% position:73% line:53%
a tenu ie Sauvageau.

00:00:05.405 --> 00:00:08.141 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- L'Action de grâce a toujours

00:00:06.406 --> 00:00:10.177 size:53% position:73% line:53%
